# Manual API checks. Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
# and click "Send Request" above each block. Requires `docker compose up`.

@api = http://localhost:5080
@jobId = {{create.response.body.$.jobId}}

### Health (API): Postgres + RabbitMQ status
GET {{api}}/health

### Health (Worker)
GET http://localhost:5081/health

### Create a job → 202 + { jobId }. Run this first; later requests reuse its jobId.
# quotes.toscrape.com is a crawler-friendly sandbox with many internal links (~50 pages at depth 1, ~150 at depth 2).
# Try "https://example.com" for a one-page site whose only link is external (ratio 0, no children).
# @name create
POST {{api}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://quotes.toscrape.com/", "maxDepth": 1 }

### Job status + progress
GET {{api}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Result tree (root is null until the worker has crawled something)
GET {{api}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/tree

### History, newest first
GET {{api}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=5

### Cancel → 202 the first time, 409 after that
POST {{api}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/cancel

### Validation → 400 with per-field errors
POST {{api}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "example.com", "maxDepth": 9 }

### Unknown job → 404
GET {{api}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Bad paging → 400
GET {{api}}/api/jobs?page=0&pageSize=500
